  "prompt": "How does the month-end close funnel in the app convert in each account segment, over all the app events (October to December 2025)? A user starts the funnel at the user's first upload_statement event. The user counts as matched with a match_transaction event at or after that first upload, and as exported with an export_report event at or after the first such match; an event before the step before does not count. A user belongs to the segment of the account of the user's app events. Return five columns, in this order: segment, uploaded, matched, exported (each a number of users) and overall_rate, exported over uploaded, as a fraction between 0 and 1. Return one row for each segment with a user who uploaded a statement. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
